"P3011801935" "And it begins. For you, this may seem like a starting point, but there is so much that has gone on before. So much that has happened, that could have happened. It all narrows now, as it draws to it's point. So small a thing, a beginning. So small a thing, an end. But there is much that will begin before the end. So much still to begin."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SI_Maros_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ScrollOfTielekku 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4282674189" "The Scroll of Tielekku"
// DetailString :
"P1875817920" "This ancient papyrus scroll is simply breathtaking. The central picture shows a powerful woman seated on a throne of gold, surrounded by faded pictograms. It would take an expert in esoteric lost languages to decipher these markings."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P297945614" "There is a matter I will need to have had your assistance with. It's a small thing, a minor theft of a precious artifact from the insane cultists of mad gods, who now defend this treasure with a religious fervor. Stealing it and delivering it into my hands will set up a chain of events whose final effects will be beyond your sight, but will lead to the eventual destruction of those cultists. <br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>So are you interested in a little theft?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P328708582" "Steal an artifact from cultists."
// SendOffString :
"P2395899973" "I knew you would agree. The item in question is called 'The Scroll of Tielekku'. It's a valuable artefact of a lost goddess. The enemies of that goddess now plan to use it to trap her. I want it so that I can surreptitiously place it in the estate of late member of the old Midnight Squad. <br><br>But that doesn't matter, really. I don't care if you sneak through without alerting any of their dead souls. I don't care if you wipe out every last cultist and zombie in the place. All I want is the scroll. The details are yours to determine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3658258165" "Steal Scroll of Tielekku"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1168846160" "I don't care if you sneak through without alerting any of their dead souls. I don't care if you wipe out every last cultist and zombie in the place. All I want is the scroll. The details are yours to determine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P210564042" "Maros is a strange one, but this his information about the location of this 'Scroll of Tielekku' was accurate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TheScroll 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2302064510" "Reliquary"
// Description :
"P2212898656" "Steal the Scroll"
// InteractBeginString :
