// DetailString :
"P2878167922" "These weapons you stole from a Longbow base were clearly designed by a brilliant mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P420279192" "Theron's armor"
// DetailString :
"P695475438" "This stolen armor looks like it could stop even the most advanced weaponry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Explosives 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3517291853" "Theron's explosives"
// DetailString :
"P3018853650" "Your seasoned eye can tell that these explosives would pack quite a punch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1610283938" "There is one in Paragon City who believes his destiny is clear. He could well be correct, if we do not move to intervene. The man's name is Dr. Theron. He is a brilliant man, a man of science. We must turn science against him, forcing him to move closer to nature. Currently, some of Theron's more remarkable devices are in the hands of Longbow. As long as they control these weapons, they will use them for the cause of good. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We must  turn the devices to evil to set Theron on his true path.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2482696174" "Steal the devices from Longbow"
// SendOffString :
"P1657159508" "A submarine does not know why it waits for you now in Port Oakes. They will completely forget even the location of the undersea Longbow base they will take you to. <br><br>Alas, poor Theron. Even now, Dr. Theron is a confused soul, who believes that by devising ultimate weapons, he can undo the grievous harms of the world and make war unthinkable. In this, he is a fool, and not the first of that kind. The loss to come, and the horrors his creations will yield, shall shatter him utterly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2418736998" "Steal Theron's devices"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2884594789" "The breaking point approaches. We must move before the time is past!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P292359798" "The sub's crew act like they don't even know you're there. They moved like puppets, but they did bring you to this hidden undersea base."

